      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process, start with Password Verification, followed by Verifiy Password."
      ],
      "justification": "The opening unit implicitly triggers the process start and explicitly defines the two sequential verification steps."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you choose \"Select Cancel\""
      ],
      "justification": "The conditional clause establishes the first XOR split and its exact guard value."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "you will be directed to iforgot.apple.com."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct mapping to the navigation target specified for the Cancel arm."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if you select \"Reset password\""
      ],
      "justification": "Exact guard condition for the second branch option."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "you will be automatically directed to iforgot.apple.com."
      ],
      "justification": "Navigation action corresponding to the Reset password selection."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b1->n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "In case you choose \"Retry\""
      ],
      "justification": "Exact guard condition for the third branch option."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "you will need to re-enter your password."
      ],
      "justification": "Action matching the Retry arm instruction."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If you need to re-enter your password, do so and then verify it."
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the verification step following re-entry and marks the implicit convergence of the retry path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n15"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After that, go to iforgot.apple.com and proceed with Reset Password."
      ],
      "justification": "Both phrasings describe the navigation to the recovery portal and the subsequent reset step, which merge at the converge node before proceeding."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once you are automatically directed to iforgot.apple.com, proceed with Reset Password."
      ],
      "justification": "Both phrasings describe the navigation to the recovery portal and the subsequent reset step, which merge at the converge node before proceeding."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the password is reset, you can return to the iTunes purchases page."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact mapping to the post-reset navigation action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "From there, select the price of the item."
      ],
      "justification": "Direct match to the item pricing step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If prompted to \"Enter Password\""
      ],
      "justification": "Establishes the second decision point and its exact prompt-matching guard."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If prompted to \"Enter Password\", verify the password."
      ],
      "justification": "Action faithfully restates the verification instruction for this prompt."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "guard:b2->n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if asked to \"Enter Apple ID\""
      ],
      "justification": "Exact guard condition for the alternative prompt."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if asked to \"Enter Apple ID\", enter the password."
      ],
      "justification": "Action precisely matches the instructed response for the Apple ID prompt."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n16"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
